text:
maya: quick design check — the primary CTA on dashboard feels sluggish when pressed; ripple lags and toast copy just says "Saved" which is ambiguous. attaching a short screen recording.

nina: can repro on mac/chrome. think the transition-delay is the culprit, there's an extra 80ms before the ripple starts.

evan: +1 to cutting it down. product preference is snappier micro-interactions (120ms total). also the pressed state is visually subtle at smaller sizes.

alex: accessibility note: ensure focus ring stays visible during the press animation and respect prefers-reduced-motion. also aria-pressed should toggle immediately even if the animation continues.

maya: copy tweak suggestion: change toast from "Saved" -> "Saved to dashboard" or "Settings saved" depending on context. helps users who perform multiple save actions.

nina: quick patch idea — remove the initial delay and shorten scale animation. current CSS snippet: ```css
.btn--primary {
  transition: transform 200ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) 80ms, box-shadow 200ms;
}
.btn--primary:active {
  transform: scale(.985);
}
```
I'll try: `transition: transform 120ms ease-out 0ms` and tweak shadow.

alex: if you change timing, also run keyboard-only tests. focus-visible should not be suppressed by the press animation. for reduced motion: `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .btn--primary { transition: none; } }`.

evan: UI copy — +1 to "Saved to dashboard". small ask: can we include an inline undo for rapid mistakes? maybe make the toast actionable.

maya: undo makes sense but keep it low friction (single click). Nina, can you prototype a 3s toast with "Undo"?

nina: yep. will ship a staging build with: 120ms press animation, no start delay, focus-visible preserved, reduced-motion respected, and toast copy updated with action.

deploy-bot: preview: https://staging.redwood.ai/ui/changes/1719801122 (deployed to staging) :rocket:

maya: thanks — will run a quick accessibility and UX sweep tomorrow morning and then we can decide if it goes to canary. :thumbsup:
